OL,3,GNEWSASchools evacuated as police
OL,4,Aurgently look into 'explosive device'
OL,5,Aemail
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome schools have been evacuated after
OL,8,Freceiving an email threatening that "an
OL,9,Fexplosive device" is located within
OL,10,Ftheir building.
OL,12,FSt Colman's PS Lambeg said that parents
OL,13,Fshould "come immediately" and collect
OL,14,Fchildren and "please don't panic the
OL,15,Fchildren are all safe". Harpur's Hill
OL,16,FPS and Rosstulla Special School have
OL,17,Falso advised that children are to be
OL,18,Fcollected.
OL,20,FThe email, seen by BBC News NI, was
OL,21,Fsent to over 100 schools across.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
