OL,3,GNEWSASchools evacuated as police
OL,4,Aurgently look into 'explosive device'
OL,5,Aemail
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,8,F(PSNI) said it received reports
OL,9,Fregarding "an email sent to a number of
OL,10,Fschools across Northern Ireland".
